  "2026-10-14T20:05:24.429Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proof: restored only engine/http-protocol.ts isWriteEndpoint to its origin/main implementation, rebuilt dist, and ran node --test --test-name-pattern='denies every cross-tenant' test/served-forge.test.ts. Exit 1: Missing expected rejection (forbidden); a read-granted caller could publish a review. Restored current function and rebuilt."
