  "2026-10-14T21:33:13.603Z",codex-agent,"Implementation commit 97375e18844a188bb98c5110cec65194cb25b03b verified. npm run release:check with a fresh HOME, GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null and GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1: exit 0, 1523/1523 tests. bun run release:check: exit 0, 1523/1523 tests. Both: zero failed/skipped/cancelled/todo; per-file 100% statements/branches/functions/lines over all 65 production files; zero lint warnings, 0% duplicates, 354 documented declarations; native TOON, stat-cache strace, committed self-host equality, production audit, Git identities, pack dry run, full changelog check, release date and publish attestation all pass. Ten served-forge scenarios pass, with real server-process tenant/lease evidence and applied-HEAD byte-identical rederivation. Authorization and field-merge behavioral rollbacks failed as expected, then current code was restored and rebuilt. No dependency pins changed and no Phase 6 implementation was added."
